			<personalityDescription>Anamaria isn&apos;t satisfied with just getting by - they want more. Whether it&apos;s climbing the ranks, commanding their own unit, or carving their name into history, they&apos;re always pushing forward, never content to stay in one place for long. Anamaria has a sharp mind and a quick understanding of how things work. Whether it&apos;s battlefield tactics, business deals, or reading people, they pick up on the important details fast and use them to their advantage. </personalityDescription>
