			<personalityDescription>When everything goes wrong, Albinia is the one still standing, ready to fight. She charges into danger not because it&apos;s easy, but because someone has to - and if that means being the last one out, so be it. Albinia never acts without a plan. Every move she makes is part of a bigger picture, ensuring that by the time her opponents realize what&apos;s happening, she&apos;s already won. </personalityDescription>
