			<personalityDescription>To Shyanne, restraint is just another word for cowardice. She overextends herself at every opportunity, chasing grand plans and high-stakes gambles, never considering that one wrong move could send it all crashing down. Shyanne&apos;s been told things would get better. That command would come through. That there was enough time, enough resources, enough hope. None of it was true. So now, she trusts nothing at face value. Because the one time she does? That&apos;s when it&apos;ll all come crashing down. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 66%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Chases every high-risk move like it&apos;s glory. Won&apos;t stop until it&apos;s wreckage.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
